-- e-hole is CHECKING-ONLY. A position that demands a SHAPE mints one
-- (elab-hole-shaped), but a position that demands NOTHING has nothing
-- to mint: a let definiens fixes no former, so the hole is rejected
-- and the remedy names the ascription lever. Same for `out`, whose
-- ν carries a POLYNOMIAL — which has no hole form at all.
def viaLet : ℕ ≔ let x ≔ ?e in x

def viaOut : ℕ ≔ out ?s
